  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the regional Gaza crisis response through the IFRC MENA Crisis Emergency Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Egyptian Red Crescent Society (ERCS), in coordination with IFRC, to scale up the supply of humanitarian aid into Gaza in the wake of the recent ceasefire agreement. The funds will contribute to the strengthening of the supply chain activities of the ERCS through the IFRC MENA Crisis Emergency Appeal (18 October 2023 to 31 December 2026)</narrative>
  </description>
